WHAT THIS LICENSE COVERS

Covered (written for Basalt): the Rust engines and tools (app-core, canvas-engine, graph-engine, markdown-engine, search-engine,
pty-helper, cli), plugins-sdk, installer scripts, build scripts, tools/, stub/, the readable own modules in src-app/ (they are
built into src/app.js), the files src/basalt-*.js, src/main.js, src/starter.*, src/help.*, src/enhance.js, src/i18n-ru.js,
src/vault-sync.js, src/fp-canvas.js (source in canvas-engine/), src/fp-graph.js (source in graph-engine/), src/worker.js (source in
markdown-engine/) and the documentation in docs/ and README.md.

NOT covered:
 - src/app.js as a whole: it still contains code of the third-party application Basalt was forked from (Obsidian 1.12.7, proprietary)
   and bundled open-source libraries. Only the parts that come from src-app/ are covered.
 - src/app.css and src-css/, src/i18n.js: derived from that application.
 - src/lib, src/vendor, src/public, src/sim.js and the other third-party libraries and fonts: they keep their own licences,
   listed in THIRD_PARTY.md.
 - the logo and icons in branding/ and src/*.png: origin not established, see THIRD_PARTY.md.
These files remain under their original terms and are not licensed by this file. See THIRD_PARTY.md and docs/CORE-REWRITE.md.
Do not redistribute builds that contain them unless those terms allow it.

